  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">📣 Last week, EFAMA’s <a class="link" href="https://be.linkedin.com/in/thomas-tilley-13085917?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Thomas Tilley</a> and <a class="link" href="https://be.linkedin.com/in/susanyavari?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Susan Yavari</a> participated in the Bulgarian Association of Asset Management Companies (<a class="link" href="https://bg.linkedin.com/company/%D0%B1%D1%8A%D0%BB%D0%B3%D0%B0%D1%80%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B0-%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%BE%D1%86%D0%B8%D0%B0%D1%86%D0%B8%D1%8F-%D0%BD%D0%B0-%D1%83%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B2%D0%BB%D1%8F%D0%B2%D0%B0%D1%89%D0%B8%D1%82%D0%B5-%D0%B4%D1%80%D1%83%D0%B6%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B2%D0%B0?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Българска асоциация на управляващите дружества</a>) conference "NextGen vol.02: New Horizons 2026" in Sofia, Bulgaria.

🎤 Thomas presented on key trends in the European and Bulgarian fund markets. Some of the key insights include:

🔸 Fund costs are coming down across all main types of long-term UCITS.
🔸 The European fund industry is becoming increasingly international.
🔸 Passive and larger funds are swiftly growing in market share
🔸 Bulgaria is a small fund market, however, its relative net asset growth in recent years was significantly stronger than in Europe as a whole.

🎤 Susan joined a panel discussion moderated by <a class="link" href="https://bg.linkedin.com/in/ilina-biserova-059728133?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Ilina Biserova</a> (<a class="link" href="https://bg.linkedin.com/company/bse-sofia?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Bulgarian Stock Exchange</a>) featuring Assoc. Prof. <a class="link" href="https://bg.linkedin.com/in/manyumoravenov?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Manyu Moravenov Ph.D MRICS</a>, Ph.D. (Bulgarian Stock Exchange), <a class="link" href="https://fr.linkedin.com/in/eglantine-desautel?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Eglantine Desautel</a> (<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/euroctp?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>EuroCTP</a>) and <a class="link" href="https://be.linkedin.com/in/ludovic-aigrot-19645766?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Ludovic Aigrot</a> (<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/nasdaq?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Nasdaq</a>) on the Consolidated Tape. The discussion highlighted several important points:
 
🔹 Most panelists agreed that introduction of a consolidated tape should not be viewed solely through the prism of market data revenues.
🔹 Exchanges’ data revenues were not at risk as the majority of subscribers will continue to consume the lower latency exchange feeds, in addition to the CT. 
🔹 A more transparent and accessible European equity market is the true prize that the CT delivers. This will benefit investment inflows, liquidity and ultimately IPO activity also.
🔹 ETFs continue to be the fastest growing segment in the fund sector. Additional transparency ( both on pre and post-trade data) supports in-flows into European ETFs, and helps ETF issuers include a broader range of shares, including small and mid-cap, as well as Central and East European stocks.

🙏 Many thanks to the panelists for an interesting discussion and to the Bulgarian Association of Asset Management Companies for the invitation. Congratulations to <a class="link" href="https://bg.linkedin.com/in/natalia-petrova-a1073a52?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Natalia Petrova</a> on all the preparation underway for the October 2027 T+1 migration.

<a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/in/jim-goldie-1818354b?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Jim Goldie</a> <a class="link" href="https://it.linkedin.com/in/giovanni-sabatini-22138b106?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Giovanni Sabatini</a> <a class="link" href="https://be.linkedin.com/in/jacopo-borgognone?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Jacopo Borgognone</a> <a class="link" href="https://fr.linkedin.com/in/ccouvidat/en?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Corentin Couvidat</a> <a class="link" href="https://in.linkedin.com/in/rajat-tawari-674105248?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Rajat Tawari</a>

<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fassetmanagement&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#AssetManagement</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fcapitalmarkets&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#CapitalMarkets</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fconsolidatedtape&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#ConsolidatedTape</a></p>
