  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">Earlier this week, <a class="link" href="https://be.linkedin.com/company/efama?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>EFAMA</a> Director General <a class="link" href="https://be.linkedin.com/in/tvandewerve?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Tanguy van de WERVE</a> spoke at the 2026 conference of <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/company/the-international-investment-funds-association?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>The International Investment Funds Association</a> (IIFA), superbly organised by <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/company/the-securities-and-investment-management-association?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>The Securities and Investment Management Association (SIMA)</a> in the beautiful city of Toronto 🇨🇦.

Speaking about ways to increase retirement savings and retail participation in capital markets, he highlighted a number of lessons from different European markets, including:

- What has proven to work

1/ The power of default

Defaults can help address inertia and overcome the behavioural tendency to postpone investing. Properly designed auto-enrolment in workplace pension schemes, with the possibility to opt out, can be highly effective, as the UK experience demonstrates.

2/ Simple tax wrappers

The success of Sweden’s Investment Savings Account (ISK) suggests that a winning formula combines a simple tax wrapper with digital distribution, simple products, low costs and a population that has become familiar with capital markets over many years.

3/ Making regular investing effortless

Investment plans with digital onboarding that enable people to invest small amounts regularly and automatically are proving increasingly successful in a number of EU countries.

- What does not work

1/ Too long and complex disclosures

Transparency is very important, but information overload must be avoided. Excessive disclosure can overwhelm investors rather than help them. The objective should be to enable informed decision-making, not to scare people away from investing. Smoking kills, investing does not.

2/ Overly stringent investor protection requirements

Investor protection is essential, but poorly designed or disproportionate requirements can inhibit both supply and demand. ELTIF 1.0 and PEPP 1.0 are notable examples.

3/ Poorly designed tax incentives

Tax incentives need to be meaningful enough to change behaviour. At the same time, if they primarily benefit higher earners who would have invested anyway, their effectiveness as a use of public money should be questioned.


The ensuing discussion with his fellow panelists from Oceania, Africa and Latin America reinforced a clear message: across markets, simplicity is essential to encouraging greater retail participation in capital markets.

From that perspective, it is highly regrettable that the Retail Investment Strategy (RIS) which will be put to a plenary vote in the European Parliament in November will add costs and complexity without sufficiently demonstrated benefits for retail investors. 

This is all the more puzzling given the broad consensus that the current text of the RIS will not achieve its objectives, while the resulting additional complexity runs directly counter to the EU’s stated commitment to simplification and competitiveness.

<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Ffund&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#fund</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fretailinvestment&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#retailinvestment</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fpension&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#pension</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fretirementsavings&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#retirementsavings</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Ftransparency&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#transparency</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fsiu&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#SIU</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.l